# Walkthrough - Academic Core Database Migration

I have successfully added the database schema migration and configured Flyway for the `academic-core-service`. Additionally, I resolved build issues caused by non-standard versions in the original `pom.xml`.

## Changes Made

### Database Migration
- Created [V1__create_academic_core_tables.sql](file:///c:/Users/maria/University-Management-System-Microservices/Backend/academic-core-Service/src/main/resources/db/migration/V1__create_academic_core_tables.sql) with the following tables:
